   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting CHOICE for Youth and Sexu</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are CHOICE for Youth and Sexuality. We are a brave, innovative and committed organisation 100% led by young people and working for young people worldwide. We believe that everyone should feel comfortable talking about their body and health, without feeling ashamed or scared. Every day, we passionately work towards our Vision: that all young people have the power to make decisions about their sexual, reproductive and love lives!

Our Mission is: CHOICE advocates with young people for their sexual andreproductive health and rights and for meaningful participation in the decisions made about their lives. We mutually strengthen the capacity of young people and youth-led organisations, supporting them to be leaders and changemakers.

We are CHOICE forYouth and Sexuality.

To achievethis, CHOICE works together with other youth led organisations all around the world as well as with youth-serving organisations. Values: We are intersectional feminists, and we aim to be sex-positive, courageous, playful,and supportive in all that we do.

In 2022, through an inclusive and participatory process, CHOICE created our current Multiannual Strategy 2023-2026 (MAS). In this strategy we selected three pillars to reach our vision. These pillars complement eachother and aim to foster sustainable change, ensuring that the outcomes will continue to replicate even after CHOICE&apos;s activities conclude

1. Youth leadership
2. Youth led advocacy for SRHR
3. Uniting youth voices</narrative>
